[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507638072","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111091#issuecomment-3507638072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111091","id":3507638072,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7REk84","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T07:57:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T07:57:09Z","body":"Behavior difference bisects to #91329.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507638072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4695876667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111091#issuecomment-4695876667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111091","id":4695876667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF-VkOw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T22:18:52Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T07:43:30Z","body":"The issue happens because when an instanced scene is duplicated, the node order is taken from the original scene instead of the live one. Which means that if the node order is modified, it will desync from the original, resulting in wrong values being set.\n\nThis didn't happen before #91329 because originally in the `_duplicate()` function while looping through the `node_tree` it used `get_path_to()` to fetch nodes ([right here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91329/changes#diff-87dda4f114b485518869c93afac19b35800f98c7f10e4681bdbba1a2ec4f1928L2775)), so the order didn't matter. But now that this is delegated to `_duplicate_properties()`, that function is only aware of the the node order from the nodes themselves.\n\nSo to fix this, we either make `_duplicate_properties()` be able to take a `List<Node*>` as the source of truth, or just revert that commit.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4695876667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]